        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tahmoh Penikett, Joss Whedon\n- Productions: Mutant Enemy Productions, Bellwether Pictures\n- TV series: Supernatural, Dollhouse, Continuum, Buffy the Vampire Slayer, Angel, Firefly, Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D., Battlestar Galactica\n- Characters: Karl C. Agathon (Helo)\n- Episodes: Meet Jane Doe\n\nFacts:\n- Joss Whedon founded Mutant Enemy Productions and co-founded Bellwether Pictures.\n- Joss Whedon created the television series Buffy the Vampire Slayer (1997–2003), Angel (1999–2004), Firefly (2002), Dollhouse (2009–10), and Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D. (from 2013).\n- Tahmoh Penikett portrayed Karl C. Agathon, also called Helo, on the re-imagined Battlestar Galactica television series.\n- Tahmoh Penikett starred in the television series Supernatural, Joss Whedon\u0019s Dollhouse, and Continuum.\n- Meet Jane Doe is the seventh episode of Dollhouse season two and the 20th episode of the series overall.",
